   "widgets_values": [
    "A weathered wooden sailboat drifts across a calm turquoise bay in the late afternoon. The single sail fills slowly as a light breeze crosses the water and the hull rocks with an even, unhurried rhythm. Sunlight scatters into bright moving ripples along the surface, and a thin trail of white foam widens behind the stern. The camera holds a steady wide shot and drifts almost imperceptibly to the right, keeping the boat just off center. Distant green headlands soften into a warm haze, seabirds glide in slow arcs overhead, and the whole scene keeps a quiet, cinematic calm."
